  "description": "SPARTA C-GRID ULTRA – POWERFUL AND MAINTENANCE-FREE IN THE CITY\nLooking for a powerful and maintenance-free e-bike for the city? Then the SPARTA c-GRID ULTRA is exactly what you're looking for. This e-bike doesn't compromise on performance, combining power and durability for carefree urban rides.\nThe c-GRID ULTRA comes standard with a 500Wh battery, a low-maintenance belt drive, and a powerful new-generation Bosch Performance Line motor. The Enviolo Trekking hub with stepless shifting ensures smooth and comfortable shifting, so you're always in control – regardless of pace or conditions.\n\nThe retail price of this e-bike includes VAT and excludes a €4.50 battery recycling fee in the Netherlands. Please note: specifications may vary. Consult the product details for the exact specifications or contact your dealer.",
